          "dosage": "Prepare seven herbs in 1 sheng (1 L) water: first boil Ephedra (Ma Huang) and Kudzu root (Ge Gen) down to 800 ml, remove scum, add remaining herbs and boil down to 300 ml; take 150 ml warm each time, cover to induce slight sweating.",
